add(42,'conjecture','15/227:L877','dans quelle mesure un morphisme … connu par le foncteur','Determine faithfulness and essential image of the contravariant passage from scheme morphisms to motivic tensor functors.','The source/target category and enrichments are not fixed, so this is not the Tate Hom theorem or an anabelian theorem for all schemes.','The text asks both recovery and arbitrary realization, with a marginal appeal to Hodge rather than a proof.')
add(43,'unproved claim','15/227:L879','Y … Modules est une immersion … anabélien','An immersive moduli map furnished by a global polarized motive is proposed as a criterion for recovering maps into Y; a field-spectrum case is also anticipated.','The uncertain anabélien, immersion type, source category and fullness hypotheses prevent a precise general theorem.','The note correctly retains all these uncertainties. A broad anabelian criterion is not stated precisely enough to verify.')
