add(45,'conjecture','18/005:L950–964','Descriptions conjecturales de motifs','Six proposed descriptions combine Betti, de Rham, Hodge, Gauss–Manin, Tate and filtered-crystalline realizations.','The categories, admissibility conditions and geometric essential images are unspecified; these are six programmes, not six established equivalences.','The heading explicitly governs all six numbered descriptions. The note correctly distinguishes a classification programme from the available particular realization comparisons.')
