add(82,'reading question','15/223:L795–796;15/227:L877–879;16/047:L1785–1796 (other package)','construire X projectif lisse','The smooth-projective conjugate-variety witness here serves place separation, whereas cote16’s abandoned smooth-hypersurface reduction and proposed singular replacement concern standard conjectures.','No supplied cote14 page verifies whether that singular-hypersurface programme was implemented.','The p16 reader confirmed the withdrawal at line1791. The note correctly separates the questions and treats missing cote14 material as an unverified lead.')
