add(84,'unpursued implication','15/213:L420–431;18/011:L1081–1088','G(X,ξ)=Aut(ξ)','Modern Nori/Ayoub reconstruction and the rational pure Nori/André comparison provide categories and groups for part of the realization programme.','They do not prove that all motivated projectors or inverse Lefschetz maps are algebraic correspondences; that needs the relevant standard conjectures.','The note’s cited constructions are later comparisons, accurately distinguished from the algebraicity claim on other sheets.')
